201:In particular, we obtain infinite families of partially balanced block designs from distance regular graphs, skew-Bush type Hadamard matrices and group divisible designs, signed hypercubes and binary Hamming schemes, and balanced generalised weighing matrices. 
202:Lastly, we show how Hadamard matrices can be used to construct infinite families of pairwise balanced designs (see Theorem~\ref{thm:hmpbd}).
