ocks with $\\det = 1$: $k_1 = \\frac{q(q^2-1)(q-3)}{32}$\n\nUsing these formulas for each given record:\n- Record 0: $q=43 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $1 \\implies k_1 = 43 \\times (43^2-1) \\times 40 / 32 = 99330$\n- Record 1: $q=53 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 4$, target $-3 \\implies k_{-3} = 53 \\times (53^2-1) \\times 48 / 96 = 74412$\n- Record 2: $q=41 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 4$, target $-3 \\implies k_{-3} = 41 \\times (41^2-1) \\times 36 / 96 = 25830$\n- Record 3: $q=67 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $1 \\implies k_1 = 67 \\times (67^2-1) \\times 64 / 32 = 601392$\n- Record 4: $q=97 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 4$, target $-3 \\implies k_{-3} = 97 \\times (97^2-1) \\times 92 / 96 = 874552$\n- Record 5: $q=71 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $9 \\implies k_9 = 71 \\times 70 \\times 72^2 / 96 = 268380$\n- Record 6: $q=61 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 4$, target $5 \\implies k_5 = 61 \\times 62 \\times 60^2 / 32 = 425475$\n- Record 7: $q=47 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $9 \\implies k_9 = 47 \\times 46 \\times 48^2 / 96 = 51888$\n- Record 8: $q=59 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $9 \\implies k_9 = 59 \\times 58 \\times 60^2 / 96 = 128325$\n- Record 9: $q=89 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 4$, target $5 \\implies k_5 = 89 \\times 90 \\times 88^2 / 32 = 1938420$\n- Record 10: $q=103 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $9 \\implies k_9 = 103 \\times 102 \\times 104^2 / 96 = 1183676$\n- Record 11: $q=79 \\equiv 3 \\pmod 4$, target $9 \\implies k_9 = 79 \\times 78 \\times 80^2 / 96 = 410800$\n\n<answer>[99330, 74412, 25830, 601392, 874552, 268380, 425475, 51888, 128325, 1938420, 1183676, 410800]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 59.0, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "hard", "escalation_round": 2}
