For a family of subsets $\mathfrak B$ of $[v]$ and a subset $\beta\subset[v]$, define 
\begin{align*}
\lambda_\mathfrak B(\beta)&:=|\{\alpha \in \mathfrak B  \; : \;  \beta \subset \alpha\}|,\\
\mu_\mathfrak B(\beta)&:=|\{\alpha \in \mathfrak B  \; : \;  \beta \cap \alpha=\emptyset\}|. 
\end{align*}
Note that $\lambda_\mathfrak B(\emptyset) = \mu_\mathfrak B(\emptyset)=|\mathfrak B|$. 

