\section{Concluding remarks and open problems}
\label{sec:open}
We conclude with some open questions which have naturally emerged throughout the course of our study.
Motivated by Example~\ref{ex:skew3}, we begin with a well-known open question originally due to \cite{S78}. 
\begin{question}
For which integers $n$ does there exist a skew-symmetric conference matrix of order $4n$? 
\end{question}
