+    "times the sum of all k-principal minors. Section 2.2 defines skew "
+    "conference matrices and the Paley construction; Example 2.4 gives "
+    "det(xI-S)=(x^2+q)^((q+1)/2) for order q+1. Remark 2.6 identifies the "
